# First-person view from the player start (TSG offscreen; same commands work in OGL/Qt)
/vis/open TSG_OFFSCREEN 960x720-0+0
/vis/tsg/offscreen/set/file e1m1_firstperson.png
/vis/drawVolume
/vis/viewer/set/style surface
/vis/viewer/set/background 0.45 0.6 0.85
/control/execute e1m1_camera.mac
/vis/viewer/set/lightsVector 0.4 1 0.6
/vis/viewer/flush
